  deepAmber:
    zoneId: the-hollows
    findsPerHour: 0.1
    pityHoursWatched: 12
    plateName: The Deep Amber
    completedLore: An insect no one living has seen, held in resin. The world it
      flew through has ended. It is in the book now, the one thing the land let me
      keep.
    effects:
    - type: 1
      skill: all
      zone: 
      resource: 
      recipe: 
      species: 
      upgrade: 
      value: 0.25
    pieces:
    - id: the-wing
      displayName: The Wing
      lore: A wing in the resin, veined like nothing the trail knows. Whatever sky
        it flew, that sky has ended.
    - id: the-seed
      displayName: The Seed
      lore: A seed, held mid-fall. Something planted in rows once, and widely. The
        rows are under the meadow.
    - id: the-ash
      displayName: The Ash
      lore: Ash caught through the amber like a held breath. The tree wept this the
        year the sky went dark, and kept weeping.
    - id: the-mark
      displayName: The Maker's Mark
      lore: A cut face, too straight for teeth. Someone worked this resin before
        it set. Their hands would have fit my gloves.
